% love_in_outer_space-chords: the chord symbols of "Love in Outer Space (F).pdf", read and placed on the
% card by muertos/tools/pdfchords.py (muertos/chords.sh --write); do not
% hand-edit. Concert pitch: Songs.ily's \transpose f c' writes them for
% the F mellophone with the notes. 6 placed, 0 left out.
% The source part sits 7 semitones above the card's concert pitch.
love_in_outer_space-chords = \transpose c f \chordmode {
	bes1*3:maj7  % m1 Bbmaj7
	a1*3:7  % m5 A7
	c1*3:m7  % m9 Cmin7
	bes1*3  % m13 Bb
	as1*3:m6  % m17 Abmin6
	bes1*3  % m21 Bb
}
